{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "vffze888lil3sqgl", "title": "从日志分析到文件处理，Linux管道命令如何改变你的效率", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"adapt\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"s7KEk\" id=\"s7KEk\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua41dfbbe\" id=\"ua41dfbbe\">一、背景</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u395bb143\" id=\"u395bb143\"><span data-lake-id=\"u55218099\" id=\"u55218099\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">在 Linux 中，管道 ( </span><code data-lake-id=\"u28aa8e43\" id=\"u28aa8e43\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf204f9f4\" id=\"uf204f9f4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">|</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6065e9cb\" id=\"u6065e9cb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">) 是一个简单但非常强大的工具，用于将一个命令的输出作为另一个命令的输入进行处理。许多开发人员往往只在简单的场景下使用管道，例如</span><code data-lake-id=\"u656c3c7f\" id=\"u656c3c7f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uebc4dbb1\" id=\"uebc4dbb1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">ls | grep</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucae41280\" id=\"ucae41280\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">，而标志着管道的潜力。 </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf77ed8ae\" id=\"uf77ed8ae\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufd34784f\" id=\"ufd34784f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">本案例通过一个真实的运维场景，演示如何利用Linux管道命令高效解决复杂问题，并挖掘其故障层次的应用。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22EeZfS%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"CezDc\" id=\"CezDc\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9919c58\" id=\"ud9919c58\">二、场景描述：日志分析</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"uf99cf84e\" id=\"uf99cf84e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u99f80529\" id=\"u99f80529\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">某公司运行一个高并发 Web 应用，日常有大量访问记录日志在文件中（如</span><code data-lake-id=\"u346cbfd5\" id=\"u346cbfd5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8de5b132\" id=\"u8de5b132\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">access.log</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u64c50fc8\" id=\"u64c50fc8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">）。一天，开发团队接到报警：</span></p><ul list=\"ua94b97da\"><li fid=\"u8e0e6fac\" data-lake-id=\"u4c58c98a\" id=\"u4c58c98a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u225d27ff\" id=\"u225d27ff\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">网站响应时间异常升高。</span></li><li fid=\"u8e0e6fac\" data-lake-id=\"u8eb5c1d6\" id=\"u8eb5c1d6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u46e5c1df\" id=\"u46e5c1df\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">希望快速找到延迟高的请求IP和访问频率，以便定位问题。</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SJIMU%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"XKXRp\" id=\"XKXRp\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua9da41a1\" id=\"ua9da41a1\">三、传统问题的解决方法</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u8eb1583b\" id=\"u8eb1583b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u81603cf2\" id=\"u81603cf2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">开发团队尝试传统方式分析日志：</span></p><ol list=\"u92ffb078\"><li fid=\"u5ea97e7b\" data-lake-id=\"u88f7fa81\" id=\"u88f7fa81\"><span data-lake-id=\"u951776ac\" id=\"u951776ac\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5010c169\" id=\"u5010c169\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub415e412\" id=\"ub415e412\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">cat</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub4d83cd2\" id=\"ub4d83cd2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">打开日志文件。</span></li><li fid=\"u5ea97e7b\" data-lake-id=\"u99a7419e\" id=\"u99a7419e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u579448b4\" id=\"u579448b4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">通过</span><code data-lake-id=\"ufd3471ac\" id=\"ufd3471ac\"><span data-lake-id=\"u685ba96c\" id=\"u685ba96c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">grep</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1743c55f\" id=\"u1743c55f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">查找高延迟请求。</span></li><li fid=\"u5ea97e7b\" data-lake-id=\"u8f2d0acd\" id=\"u8f2d0acd\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf7232940\" id=\"uf7232940\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">使用统计脚本访问IP。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ua6411fa7\" id=\"ua6411fa7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0e5c3351\" id=\"u0e5c3351\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">但问题：</span></p><ul list=\"u8fd1f320\"><li fid=\"u50d484eb\" data-lake-id=\"ufc692b20\" id=\"ufc692b20\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0e98abdf\" id=\"u0e98abdf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">日志文件很大（10GB+），直接用脚本处理非常慢。</span></li><li fid=\"u50d484eb\" data-lake-id=\"u5cb5a2de\" id=\"u5cb5a2de\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub59b0af3\" id=\"ub59b0af3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">分析步骤复杂，容易出错。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u89757264\" id=\"u89757264\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue22685d7\" id=\"ue22685d7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">解决方案</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0988d6c1\" id=\"u0988d6c1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：利用管道命令，快速完成分析。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nIQ7O%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"XoDDr\" id=\"XoDDr\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8de8d0b7\" id=\"u8de8d0b7\">四、管道命令解决方案</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"xcQCc\" id=\"xcQCc\"><span data-lake-id=\"uedd18708\" id=\"uedd18708\">目标</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u805f7900\" id=\"u805f7900\"><span data-lake-id=\"u83cfccda\" id=\"u83cfccda\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">快速完成以下任务：</span></p><ol list=\"u01fe580c\"><li fid=\"uc50a770a\" data-lake-id=\"u3ed51fd9\" id=\"u3ed51fd9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud15139fd\" id=\"ud15139fd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">查找响应时间超过3秒的请求。</span></li><li fid=\"uc50a770a\" data-lake-id=\"uce87b784\" id=\"uce87b784\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud4ddb33a\" id=\"ud4ddb33a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">这些提取请求的访问IP。</span></li><li fid=\"uc50a770a\" data-lake-id=\"u2771ee29\" id=\"u2771ee29\"><span data-lake-id=\"u008acd32\" id=\"u008acd32\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">统计IP的访问频率，并按降序排列。</span></li></ol><h2 data-lake-id=\"pRcWV\" id=\"pRcWV\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud058c2b6\" id=\"ud058c2b6\">命令</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22cat%20access.log%20%7C%20awk%20'%24NF%20%3E%203%20%7Bprint%20%241%7D'%20%7C%20sort%20%7C%20uniq%20-c%20%7C%20sort%20-nr%20%7C%20head%20-n%2010%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nealH%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22NZbpu%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"RqUDw\" id=\"RqUDw\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf2c4dee9\" id=\"uf2c4dee9\">五、分步骤解释</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"HzfbY\" id=\"HzfbY\"><span data-lake-id=\"u40dd961a\" id=\"u40dd961a\">1.查找高位请求</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u8b88e9e6\" id=\"u8b88e9e6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1cd14402\" id=\"u1cd14402\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u233c4c28\" id=\"u233c4c28\"><span data-lake-id=\"u917062f3\" id=\"u917062f3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">awk</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub7fae88d\" id=\"ub7fae88d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">处理日志，假设日志格式如下：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22192.168.0.1%20-%20-%20%5B23%2FNov%2F2024%3A10%3A00%3A01%20%2B0000%5D%20%5C%22GET%20%2Findex.html%20HTTP%2F1.1%5C%22%20200%201024%202.5%5Cn192.168.0.2%20-%20-%20%5B23%2FNov%2F2024%3A10%3A00%3A02%20%2B0000%5D%20%5C%22POST%20%2Flogin%20HTTP%2F1.1%5C%22%20200%20512%204.2%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22trUmG%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u0f72550b\" id=\"u0f72550b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud3e58e62\" id=\"ud3e58e62\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">日志的最后一列是响应时间，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u40bcf7f3\" id=\"u40bcf7f3\"><span data-lake-id=\"uef74115c\" id=\"uef74115c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">$NF</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud05d1c35\" id=\"ud05d1c35\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">表示最后一列。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22cat%20access.log%20%7C%20awk%20'%24NF%20%3E%203%20%7Bprint%20%241%7D'%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JBOcu%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"qNohP\" id=\"qNohP\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1cdf36bc\" id=\"u1cdf36bc\">解释：</span></h3><ul list=\"u0429b9cb\"><li fid=\"u4f090fa6\" data-lake-id=\"u1843c890\" id=\"u1843c890\"><code data-lake-id=\"ue44805d6\" id=\"ue44805d6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1dbefb22\" id=\"u1dbefb22\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">cat access.log</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1f5e41e4\" id=\"u1f5e41e4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：读取清单。</span></li><li fid=\"u4f090fa6\" data-lake-id=\"u5e78758c\" id=\"u5e78758c\"><code data-lake-id=\"u05e8b2b6\" id=\"u05e8b2b6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u024c272e\" id=\"u024c272e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">awk '$NF &gt; 3 {print $1}'</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u788baf97\" id=\"u788baf97\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：过滤出响应时间大于3秒的行，并输出IP地址（第1列）。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"zYjme\" id=\"zYjme\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucd7f0311\" id=\"ucd7f0311\">结果：</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22192.168.0.2%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DQwLr%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JcTc6%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"kCIOh\" id=\"kCIOh\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucd05fc8e\" id=\"ucd05fc8e\">2. 统计访问 IP 频率</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uf6d5ba5d\" id=\"uf6d5ba5d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u92b0af2f\" id=\"u92b0af2f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">将提取的IP进行统计：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22cat%20access.log%20%7C%20awk%20'%24NF%20%3E%203%20%7Bprint%20%241%7D'%20%7C%20sort%20%7C%20uniq%20-c%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ah0uP%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"JnFl8\" id=\"JnFl8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1d470ce9\" id=\"u1d470ce9\">解释：</span></h3><ul list=\"uead0b48b\"><li fid=\"u963783a9\" data-lake-id=\"u763fa32f\" id=\"u763fa32f\"><code data-lake-id=\"u5bc92a79\" id=\"u5bc92a79\"><span data-lake-id=\"u613fe4d1\" id=\"u613fe4d1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">sort</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uceb8b50e\" id=\"uceb8b50e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：将IP按照字母顺序排序，依次进行后续统计。</span></li><li fid=\"u963783a9\" data-lake-id=\"u02d9e98f\" id=\"u02d9e98f\"><code data-lake-id=\"u7fc46f51\" id=\"u7fc46f51\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0a4723ee\" id=\"u0a4723ee\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">uniq -c</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubd85abb7\" id=\"ubd85abb7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：统计每个IP的出现次数。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"yKatd\" id=\"yKatd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5a3883a9\" id=\"u5a3883a9\">结果：</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%223%20192.168.0.2%5Cn2%20192.168.0.3%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LoxPY%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Yh9fN%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"lPPTK\" id=\"lPPTK\"><span data-lake-id=\"u902ef166\" id=\"u902ef166\">3.按降序排列</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u578684e9\" id=\"u578684e9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u971061d6\" id=\"u971061d6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">对统计结果按频率排序</span><span data-lake-id=\"u72996bc9\" id=\"u72996bc9\">：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22cat%20access.log%20%7C%20awk%20'%24NF%20%3E%203%20%7Bprint%20%241%7D'%20%7C%20sort%20%7C%20uniq%20-c%20%7C%20sort%20-nr%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xbqbK%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3At